        "message": {
          "content": "**A**\n\nThe goal should be to maximize total well-being and the overall quality of life across the entire population. In a society where almost every tier experiences significantly higher living standards, the aggregate happiness, health, and flourishing generated vastly outweigh the deficits at the margin. When considering the expected outcome for any random individual, the probability of enjoying a substantially richer, more capable, and comfortable life is extremely high, making it the choice that produces the greatest net good for the greatest number of people.",
